Description: Aegis OS — full metapackage
 Installs the complete Aegis OS integration. Adding the Aegis APT repository and
 installing this package turns a Debian system into Aegis OS; the Aegis live and
 installer images are built from it. As more components are packaged
 (aegis-anon, aegis-live, aegis-desktop, aegis-control) they are added here.
